  "label": "User projected onto the derogatory animal association scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the goat is visually associated with the hateful stereotype of Muslims. The meme does not contain explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the overall intent and framing of the image and text create an implicit projection where the viewer is expected to identify with or internalize the stereotype being presented. The user is projected onto the scene of the derogatory animal association, which is the central visual and textual construct of the meme.",
